{"1570840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tides of Tethys", "steam_appid": 1570840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo 2.0, out now!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tides of Tethys</strong> is an immersive underwater roguelite simulation game about exploring and surviving the uncharted depths of an alien world, while building and maintaining modular outposts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will lead expeditions of Knights into the unknown, in the hopes of rebuilding their long lost kingdom and unifying the houses of Tethys once again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they dive further into the Abyss, they will discover compelling new places, uncover lost technologies, and conquer a variety of dangers that lurk beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE WORLD OF TETHYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Tethys is a dangerous and diverse one.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each expedition comes new locations to discover, and with each depth, new challenges to overcome! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EXPLORE AND ADAPT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an expedition leader, you will lead your trusted Knights to explore and retrieve long-lost Relics from the ancient wars that divided the Houses of Tethys..   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieving Relics will allow you to retrofit that technology on your outposts, as well as your Knights and let you adapt to the ever growing challenges of the deep!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CONQUER THE ABYSS, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each conquest and failure comes knowledge and rewards!<br><br>  Will you unlock more ways to navigate the tides, upgrade your mothership to carry over more of your outpost each depth, or maybe try out a run with a newly unlocked House, offering its own set of advantages and challenges? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features :</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever changing procedural world, where no two expeditions are the same, and delve deeper into the uncharted trenches of the Abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build modular outposts, and transport parts of it with in your Mothership to help you survive the challenges of the deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient Relics to uncover lost technology for your outposts as well as tools and vehicles for your Knights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each expedition, choose between meaningful perks to help you survive the trenches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your Kingdom to its former glory! With each victorious expedition, unlock more perks, tools, factions and customizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's conditions like darkness, changing current speeds or simply running into events that require you to make snap decisions... What will you do, faced against the unknown?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tides of Tethys</strong> is an immersive underwater roguelite simulation game about exploring and surviving the uncharted depths of an alien world, while building and maintaining modular outposts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will lead expeditions of Knights into the unknown, in the hopes of rebuilding their long lost kingdom and unifying the houses of Tethys once again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they dive further into the Abyss, they will discover compelling new places, uncover lost technologies, and conquer a variety of dangers that lurk beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE WORLD OF TETHYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Tethys is a dangerous and diverse one.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each expedition comes new locations to discover, and with each depth, new challenges to overcome! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/1e5c6dc054a6f26cf2cb75b58c598ef9.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EXPLORE AND ADAPT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an expedition leader, you will lead your trusted Knights to explore and retrieve long-lost Relics from the ancient wars that divided the Houses of Tethys..   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieving Relics will allow you to retrofit that technology on your outposts, as well as your Knights and let you adapt to the ever growing challenges of the deep!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/e94c224186a6f6cc544dcfa4845c41c3.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CONQUER THE ABYSS, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each conquest and failure comes knowledge and rewards!<br><br>  Will you unlock more ways to navigate the tides, upgrade your mothership to carry over more of your outpost each depth, or maybe try out a run with a newly unlocked House, offering its own set of advantages and challenges? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.poster.avif?t=1786482185\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.webm?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/extras/9c9954d315b0e9e6d25589c380c061d0.mp4?t=1786482185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features :</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever changing procedural world, where no two expeditions are the same, and delve deeper into the uncharted trenches of the Abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build modular outposts, and transport parts of it with in your Mothership to help you survive the challenges of the deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient Relics to uncover lost technology for your outposts as well as tools and vehicles for your Knights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each expedition, choose between meaningful perks to help you survive the trenches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your Kingdom to its former glory! With each victorious expedition, unlock more perks, tools, factions and customizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's conditions like darkness, changing current speeds or simply running into events that require you to make snap decisions... What will you do, faced against the unknown?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A tactical exploration building game where you explore the uncharted depths of Tethys; scavenging resources and lost technologies, to survive the dangers of the abyss. As the Overseer, lead expeditions of Knights through the dark trenches and the unknown, and help them rebuild their lost Kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "reviews": "“That's a really cool idea and I'm excited to see how it plays out”<br> Splattercatgaming<br><br>“Tides of Tethys is quite beautiful, and has much potential to grow into an absorbing strategy exploration experience.”<br>IGR<br><br>“They have the makings of something engrossing here”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/header.jpg?t=1786482185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786482185", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786482185", "website": "http://www.Black-Rust.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4720HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-5960x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements